  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sam has a toy shop. It is on the floor. Leo comes to the shop. \"Hello, Sam!\" says Leo. \"I want a helicopter.\" \"I have two,\" says Sam. \"Red or blue?\" \"Blue, please,\" says Leo. Sam gives Leo the helicopter.",
      "\"Look!\" says Sam. These are my lorries. \"One, two, three lorries!\" \"A monster!\" says Leo. \"Yes.\" It is funny. \"It has four eyes!\" \"Is it ugly?\" asks Leo. \"No, it is nice.\"",
      "Sam has fruit too. \"Four apples.\" \"Five bananas.\" \"How many fruits?\" asks Sam. \"Nine!\" says Leo. \"Good!\" says Sam. Leo eats an apple. It is good."
    ],
    "summary": "Sam plays shop with his toys on the floor. Leo counts the lorries and the fruit.",
